### Section B checks for the Dispatch mock. Run top to bottom against a FRESHLY STARTED app (port 8080).
### In IntelliJ: click the green arrow next to each ### block.

### B0: list seeded missions (expect 101, 102, 103)
GET http://localhost:8080/missions

### B1: Ground 101 energy -> {"energyUnits":39}
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/101/energy

### B2: Air 103 energy -> {"energyUnits":38}
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/103/energy

### B3: capacity 60 -> selected [103,102], skipped [101], used 56, remaining 4
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/plan?capacity=60&urgentOnly=false

### B3b: urgentOnly omitted must behave like false (default)
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/plan?capacity=60

### B4: urgent only -> selected [103], skipped [101]; 102 in neither list
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/plan?capacity=60&urgentOnly=true

### B1b: see priority 3 of mission 101 inside a PlanLine
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/plan?capacity=200&urgentOnly=false

### B5a: capacity 0 -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/plan?capacity=0&urgentOnly=false

### B5b: negative capacity -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/plan?capacity=-5&urgentOnly=false

### B5c: unknown mission -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8080/missions/999/energy

### B5d: duplicate ID (103 exists) -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/missions/air
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":103,"distanceKm":6,"loadKg":1,"windPenalty":2,"critical":false}

### B5e: distanceKm 0 out of range -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/missions/air
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":500,"distanceKm":0,"loadKg":1,"windPenalty":2,"critical":false}

### B5f: loadKg 10001 out of range -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/missions/air
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":501,"distanceKm":5,"loadKg":10001,"windPenalty":2,"critical":false}

### B5g: id 0 out of range -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/missions/air
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":0,"distanceKm":5,"loadKg":1,"windPenalty":2,"critical":false}

